.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-server-firewall-list - Inbound firewall rules


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro server firewall list  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Inbound firewall rules

.PP
Read-only in v1. An empty list means no Gyro firewall is applied (all inbound traffic reaches the server). tr-ist-1: rules come from the network firewall add-on (security groups); without the add-on the list is empty and writes answer 409 \fBfirewall_not_enabled\fR\&.

.PP
API: GET /cloud/servers/{id}/firewall (operationId getFirewall, scope cloud_read)


